Package: com.greatlove.rctl
Name: rctl
Version: 0.3.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Low-latency remote control for jailbroken iOS — live screen + touch/keyboard injection, controllable from a browser. Successor to Veency, modeled on scrcpy.
